Design
------
The "notebook" visual design system — site/assets/brand.css (above its "Quant Notebook
extensions" block), the page templates in tools/templates/, and the forked tools
tools/scaffold.py and tools/check_session.py — comes from the course-notebook-design skill
by Georges Verouchis, released here under the MIT licence.

